      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The deliverable catheter length of the Palmaz-Schatz stent delivery system is significantly limited by the protective sheath and clamshell device. This limitation must be considered when planning distal stent placement, especially in bypass graft lesions. A technique for shortening the guide catheter without losing guidewire position is described."},
